WEBVTT

01:30.350 --> 01:34.979
[The Heir]

01:35.340 --> 01:37.940
[Episode 34]

01:44.479 --> 01:46.430
After being busy for over half a month,

01:46.430 --> 01:47.920
I can finally relax a bit

01:48.759 --> 01:51.289
and have some time to check on
our pine forest.

01:54.560 --> 01:56.400
If this pine forest

01:56.400 --> 01:58.350
can survive its first winter,

01:58.710 --> 01:59.840
next spring,

02:00.200 --> 02:01.760
we'll plant some new saplings.

02:01.760 --> 02:02.760
In 2 or 3 years,

02:02.870 --> 02:05.130
it will be a completely different scene.

02:06.310 --> 02:07.000
Look.

02:07.430 --> 02:09.889
The 2 little pine trees
we picked are so cute.

02:10.560 --> 02:11.840
I can already imagine

02:11.940 --> 02:12.940
that one day,

02:13.080 --> 02:14.630
when our hair is all white,

02:14.870 --> 02:16.560
they'll be

02:16.630 --> 02:18.360
20 or 30 chi tall.

02:21.750 --> 02:23.150
I'm talking to you.

02:23.200 --> 02:25.200
Why are you so absent-minded today?

02:25.360 --> 02:26.190
I'm not.

02:27.840 --> 02:28.640
You're tired?

02:29.430 --> 02:31.290
How could I be tired when I see you?

02:32.520 --> 02:34.910
It's just that
when I left the city a while ago,

02:34.910 --> 02:37.640
seeing the bodies of starving people
everywhere

02:37.960 --> 02:39.280
made me a bit sad.

02:41.870 --> 02:45.200
In the past, when I was
fighting enemies on the battlefield,

02:45.430 --> 02:47.030
I never thought about death,

02:47.750 --> 02:49.240
nor was I ever afraid of it.

02:50.710 --> 02:51.590
Because

02:52.310 --> 02:55.310
there probably wouldn't be anyone
to collect my body.

02:56.400 --> 02:57.430
So I thought,

02:57.800 --> 02:58.800
wherever I fall,

02:59.910 --> 03:02.170
just burying me on the spot would be fine.

03:04.000 --> 03:05.080
But now,

03:09.080 --> 03:10.610
ever since I came to Huizhou

03:11.960 --> 03:13.000
and met you...

03:18.190 --> 03:20.920
Death is no longer something
I can face so easily.

03:22.150 --> 03:23.360
Death? Bah!

03:23.590 --> 03:25.190
Stop saying such depressing things.

03:25.190 --> 03:27.250
Aren't we living perfectly fine now?

03:27.590 --> 03:29.240
We still have a long life ahead of us.

03:29.240 --> 03:31.240
We must cherish the days we have now.

03:32.680 --> 03:33.590
Before that,

03:33.590 --> 03:35.520
you still have a lot of things to do.

03:35.960 --> 03:36.590
Look.

03:36.750 --> 03:37.910
Every year, Li Ink

03:37.910 --> 03:40.360
has to open a new ink shop in a new place,
right?

03:40.360 --> 03:41.960
You have to be with me, right?

03:42.030 --> 03:43.590
And we need to take part in the

03:43.590 --> 03:45.470
Tribute Ink selection together
4 years from now.

03:45.470 --> 03:46.910
And looking at the near future,

03:46.910 --> 03:49.440
when the ink workshop
takes a break next year,

03:49.560 --> 03:50.960
I want to go see the ocean.

03:51.079 --> 03:52.150
At that time,

03:52.280 --> 03:54.140
you definitely have to go with me.

03:57.870 --> 04:00.000
Why do you keep looking at me like that?

04:01.870 --> 04:02.930
You are beautiful.

04:04.430 --> 04:05.830
I want to look at you more.

04:07.080 --> 04:08.540
You're being silly again.

04:10.150 --> 04:12.960
What I just said was all a joke.

04:14.000 --> 04:14.800
However,

04:15.840 --> 04:17.680
if an accident ever happens to me one day,

04:17.680 --> 04:19.430
you must remember to bury me

04:19.510 --> 04:21.839
under the pine trees we planted together.

04:24.000 --> 04:25.120
Here you go again.

04:25.190 --> 04:27.390
Saying these depressing things again.

04:28.910 --> 04:30.610
I don't like these jokes of yours.

04:30.610 --> 04:32.409
Don't say it again in the future.

04:38.190 --> 04:39.600
We still have

04:40.190 --> 04:41.480
a long life ahead of us.

04:41.870 --> 04:42.870
We must

04:43.510 --> 04:45.170
take our time living our days.

05:01.370 --> 05:05.280
[Li Ink]

05:07.510 --> 05:08.390
Manager Zhen.

05:08.630 --> 05:09.480
I'm back.

05:10.120 --> 05:11.650
Why did you bring this back?

05:12.480 --> 05:13.480
Don't mention it.

05:14.240 --> 05:16.070
Yihousheng suddenly closed today.

05:16.070 --> 05:17.470
I went there for nothing.

05:17.720 --> 05:18.600
It's closed?

05:19.750 --> 05:21.240
At this time every month,

05:21.630 --> 05:23.430
we deliver his dividends to him.

05:23.720 --> 05:25.000
He knows this too.

05:25.190 --> 05:26.630
How could it suddenly close down?

05:26.630 --> 05:27.690
I'm wondering too.

05:28.120 --> 05:29.560
But I asked all the neighbors,

05:29.560 --> 05:31.020
and none of them knows why.

05:31.240 --> 05:33.100
I couldn't find Master Qi either.

05:40.240 --> 05:41.120
Granny.

05:41.800 --> 05:42.480
Doggie.

05:42.720 --> 05:44.800
Why did you come back late today?

05:45.159 --> 05:47.190
I've heated the food several times.

05:47.600 --> 05:49.310
I went looking for someone.

05:50.000 --> 05:51.830
Master Qi, whom you've met before.

05:51.830 --> 05:53.390
He suddenly disappeared.

05:53.600 --> 05:55.920
Manager Zhen told me to ask around.

05:55.950 --> 05:58.190
I ran all over
inside and outside the city,

05:58.190 --> 05:59.720
but there was no news at all.

06:46.560 --> 06:47.600
Are you sure?

06:49.800 --> 06:51.680
Although the door of the ink workshop
was locked,

06:51.680 --> 06:53.070
the scent of ink from the courtyard

06:53.070 --> 06:54.480
could not be hidden.

06:54.560 --> 06:55.720
And outside the doors,

06:55.720 --> 06:58.270
there were fresh carriage tracks.

06:58.310 --> 06:59.159
Someone must have

06:59.159 --> 07:01.360
just delivered something out of there.

07:02.190 --> 07:04.050
I wanted to go in and investigate.

07:04.620 --> 07:06.020
But listening closely,

07:06.390 --> 07:07.750
I heard voices inside.

07:08.270 --> 07:10.310
It was inconvenient to act during the day,

07:10.310 --> 07:11.870
so I had to come back first.

07:13.680 --> 07:14.940
Here's what you'll do.

07:16.160 --> 07:18.510
I put all the documents
related to military supplies

07:18.510 --> 07:19.750
at Yihousheng.

07:19.920 --> 07:21.160
Go to Yihousheng to fetch them,

07:21.160 --> 07:23.120
and we'll meet at the military camp later.

07:23.120 --> 07:23.950
Okay, Master.

07:30.560 --> 07:32.630
Since we've confirmed
it's that ink workshop,

07:32.630 --> 07:34.230
let's go to the military camp

07:34.240 --> 07:36.360
and ask General Yu
to lead his men to search it.

07:36.360 --> 07:37.920
Wouldn't that be safer?

07:38.750 --> 07:41.430
If we rashly ask General Yu
to deploy troops,

07:42.560 --> 07:44.420
not only might we alert the enemy,

07:44.480 --> 07:45.740
but if we find nothing,

07:45.950 --> 07:48.720
the people behind the Tian family
will use it against us,

07:48.720 --> 07:51.159
claiming we abuse our power
for personal gain.

07:51.159 --> 07:51.830
By then,

07:51.830 --> 07:54.159
it will bring great trouble
to Marshal Qi.

07:55.010 --> 07:56.950
I can only go alone tonight.

07:57.159 --> 08:00.000
Only after I find the Tian family's
contraband ink

08:00.120 --> 08:01.920
can we guarantee our next steps—

08:01.920 --> 08:03.040
catch them red-handed

08:03.040 --> 08:04.840
and make everything foolproof.

08:07.510 --> 08:08.720
Then be careful.

08:09.830 --> 08:11.030
Don't worry, Sister.

08:15.560 --> 08:16.310
And this.

08:16.390 --> 08:17.950
This box contains

08:17.950 --> 08:19.240
the severance agreement
between Yihousheng and

08:19.240 --> 08:21.510
Li Ink Workshop,

08:22.390 --> 08:23.800
just in case.

08:27.510 --> 08:29.620
We'll meet at the military camp tonight.

08:29.620 --> 08:30.160
Brother.

08:31.240 --> 08:32.500
A letter from Nanjing.

08:45.750 --> 08:47.750
He really deserves his title
as Commander of Nanjing.

08:47.750 --> 08:48.870
So fast.

08:49.480 --> 08:50.360
They have already found

08:50.360 --> 08:52.200
people in Liaodong
who have seen Luo Wenqian

08:52.200 --> 08:54.550
and got in touch with his classmates
from the academy in the Capital.

08:54.550 --> 08:56.000
By my calculation,

08:57.270 --> 09:00.000
they should arrive in Huizhou
tomorrow morning.

09:01.150 --> 09:01.870
Bensheng,

09:02.270 --> 09:03.720
you must receive them properly.

09:03.720 --> 09:04.980
As soon as they arrive,

09:05.000 --> 09:07.000
we'll immediately go to
the government office to file a lawsuit.

09:07.000 --> 09:08.000
Don't worry, Brother.

09:08.000 --> 09:09.530
I'll arrange it right away.

09:10.150 --> 09:10.750
Come back.

09:11.480 --> 09:12.810
What's wrong, Brother?

09:19.480 --> 09:21.880
Where did the ink on your clothes
come from?

09:22.670 --> 09:23.320
Brother!

09:23.630 --> 09:24.240
Brother!

09:24.720 --> 09:25.480
Brother!

09:26.550 --> 09:28.280
You are busy with many affairs.

09:28.360 --> 09:29.480
Today, I went to that ink workshop

09:29.480 --> 09:31.200
on your behalf to take a look

09:31.240 --> 09:32.150
and urged them to speed up the progress.

09:32.150 --> 09:32.960
Idiot!

09:33.510 --> 09:34.550
Who told you to go?

09:34.550 --> 09:35.840
How many times have I told you?

09:35.840 --> 09:37.030
Things are tense recently.

09:37.030 --> 09:38.270
Stay quietly in the house

09:38.270 --> 09:39.550
and don't go out to cause trouble!

09:39.550 --> 09:41.460
I meant well, Brother!

09:42.750 --> 09:44.200
You went there today.

09:45.000 --> 09:47.330
The ink workshop might have been exposed.

09:47.790 --> 09:48.670
You know that?

09:48.670 --> 09:49.240
Brother,

09:49.960 --> 09:51.150
I won't dare anymore.

09:51.150 --> 09:53.440
I will never act on my own again.

10:00.600 --> 10:01.910
Call your brothers.

10:01.910 --> 10:03.550
Follow me to that ink workshop.

10:03.550 --> 10:05.680
We must clear everything out tonight.

10:16.020 --> 10:18.950
[Yihousheng]

10:32.910 --> 10:34.240
Sorry, we're closed.

10:34.840 --> 10:35.790
Jixiang.

10:39.000 --> 10:40.030
You are Jixiang?

10:41.030 --> 10:41.600
You...

10:42.720 --> 10:43.960
You are Miss Luo?

10:46.630 --> 10:47.270
Come.

10:47.600 --> 10:49.870
My Lady, how did you survive?

10:50.150 --> 10:50.950
Jixiang.

10:51.670 --> 10:52.510
Tell me,

10:52.510 --> 10:53.550
where is Wenqian?

10:54.910 --> 10:56.790
I know he came back for revenge,

10:57.480 --> 11:00.140
but I don't want him
to do anything stupid again.

11:04.870 --> 11:06.870
Granny, why are you here?

11:08.270 --> 11:09.750
Granny, what are you doing?

11:09.750 --> 11:10.750
Please get up.

11:14.400 --> 11:15.950
I am Luo Mengzhen.

11:16.630 --> 11:18.840
Manager Zhen, please save my nephew,

11:19.080 --> 11:20.720
Luo Wenqian.

12:20.120 --> 12:20.870
Who's there?

12:22.270 --> 12:23.840
Go! Take him down!

12:29.360 --> 12:31.080
Do you know what you are doing?

12:31.480 --> 12:33.440
You are engaged in illicit foreign trade!

12:33.440 --> 12:35.150
It's a capital crime in Ming!

12:35.550 --> 12:37.210
Don't listen to his nonsense!

12:38.320 --> 12:39.520
Whoever captures him

12:40.080 --> 12:41.960
will be rewarded with 100 taels of silver!

12:41.960 --> 12:42.440
Go.

12:50.360 --> 12:50.960
Go!

12:56.780 --> 12:58.360
Go find Officer Zhang immediately!

12:58.360 --> 12:59.030
Hurry!

12:59.030 --> 12:59.630
Okay.

13:08.200 --> 13:09.080
Stop him!

13:14.790 --> 13:15.320
Go!

13:28.390 --> 13:29.670
Go!

13:30.320 --> 13:31.320
Go!

13:34.790 --> 13:35.670
Nobody move!

13:38.670 --> 13:39.750
Block the door!

13:42.440 --> 13:43.390
Who are you?

13:44.050 --> 13:44.980
Turn around!

13:52.720 --> 13:53.720
Qi Jiu?

13:54.200 --> 13:55.080
Mr. Zhang,

13:55.360 --> 13:59.160
he is the wanted criminal from
the Luo family back then—Luo Wenqian!

14:01.240 --> 14:03.900
I don't understand a single word
you're saying.

14:04.000 --> 14:05.670
Officers,

14:05.750 --> 14:06.870
I have been

14:08.060 --> 14:10.440
secretly investigating Tian Benchang

14:11.120 --> 14:13.320
for the crime of illicit foreign trade!

14:14.030 --> 14:15.790
The evidence of his crime

14:16.150 --> 14:19.480
is in the room behind me.

14:19.750 --> 14:21.720
If you don't believe me,

14:22.390 --> 14:25.510
you can come in with me
and see for yourselves!

14:25.510 --> 14:26.270
Mr. Zhang!

14:26.320 --> 14:27.720
Don't fall for his trick!

14:28.480 --> 14:29.630
Listen up!

14:30.120 --> 14:32.240
Arrest the wanted criminal, Luo Wenqian!

14:32.240 --> 14:32.910
Go!

14:52.750 --> 14:53.550
Take him away!

15:11.750 --> 15:12.870
Don't worry, My Lady.

15:12.870 --> 15:14.440
Master asked us
to meet at the military camp.

15:14.440 --> 15:16.500
He should have arrived safely by now.

15:24.550 --> 15:26.550
Hurry up and put out the lights!

15:31.480 --> 15:32.390
Master?

15:41.080 --> 15:41.870
Come back!

15:42.150 --> 15:43.120
Where are you going?

15:43.120 --> 15:43.840
Are you crazy?

15:43.840 --> 15:45.080
Going out now is a death wish.

15:45.080 --> 15:46.320
Master's life is my life.

15:46.320 --> 15:47.850
If you go out and get caught,

15:47.870 --> 15:49.080
who will save him?

15:49.630 --> 15:50.960
You'll all die in there!

15:51.270 --> 15:52.270
Tell me the truth.

15:52.720 --> 15:53.750
What happened?

15:54.120 --> 15:57.600
Master is investigating the Tian family's
illicit foreign trade.

15:57.600 --> 15:58.390
But Tian Benchang

15:58.390 --> 16:00.450
has started to suspect his identity.

16:01.080 --> 16:02.880
Cuiqiao persuaded him to leave.

16:03.870 --> 16:05.320
But Master felt that if he left,

16:05.320 --> 16:07.200
it would put us all in danger.

16:10.240 --> 16:11.960
Why didn't I stop him?

16:12.440 --> 16:14.100
Let's go to the military camp.

16:14.240 --> 16:15.030
Hurry!

16:15.870 --> 16:16.630
Hurry up!

16:23.390 --> 16:24.240
General,

16:24.480 --> 16:26.750
considering Qi Jiu risked his life

16:26.910 --> 16:28.790
and fought for the Qi Army,

16:28.840 --> 16:30.080
please save him!

16:30.540 --> 16:31.620
How can I save him?

16:32.430 --> 16:34.830
That kid was stubborn and wouldn't listen.

16:35.120 --> 16:36.520
There's nothing I can do.

16:37.390 --> 16:38.600
To tell you the truth,

16:39.320 --> 16:41.380
when he came from the north to join me,

16:41.670 --> 16:43.800
he had already prepared for the worst.

16:44.390 --> 16:45.240
He said that

16:45.360 --> 16:46.550
if one day,

16:46.960 --> 16:48.840
his true identity was exposed,

16:49.320 --> 16:51.320
he would take all the blame himself.

16:51.910 --> 16:54.910
At that time,
not only would we not protect him,

16:55.030 --> 16:55.960
we would also...

16:56.150 --> 16:57.200
Also what?

16:58.080 --> 16:59.960
We would also accuse him

17:00.480 --> 17:02.390
of deception at court first.

17:03.630 --> 17:04.550
General!

17:04.960 --> 17:06.640
Please allow me to go to the prison
right now

17:06.640 --> 17:07.750
and rescue Master!

17:07.750 --> 17:09.109
If you spout nonsense again,

17:09.109 --> 17:10.970
I will punish you by military law!

17:12.550 --> 17:14.680
Wenqian didn't want to implicate you,

17:14.680 --> 17:16.540
so he deliberately sent you away.

17:16.640 --> 17:18.569
If you walk right into the trap now,

17:18.640 --> 17:21.170
wouldn't you be failing
his good intentions?

17:39.440 --> 17:40.240
Zhen.

17:41.480 --> 17:43.680
This was prepared for you by my brother.

17:56.750 --> 17:58.480
He has already

17:59.030 --> 18:01.090
completely severed the partnership

18:01.350 --> 18:02.680
and financial dealings

18:03.070 --> 18:04.800
between Yihousheng and Li Ink.

18:04.830 --> 18:07.760
Even if there is a court confrontation
in the future,

18:07.880 --> 18:09.740
it won't implicate the Li family.

18:17.830 --> 18:19.110
Forging an identity,

18:21.270 --> 18:22.680
evading arrest,

18:23.510 --> 18:24.720
and deceiving the Qi Army—

18:24.720 --> 18:26.400
these crimes combined...

18:28.270 --> 18:29.160
Combined...

18:30.550 --> 18:32.480
He can't escape the death penalty.

18:40.110 --> 18:41.110
General!

18:41.610 --> 18:43.460
General, please save him!

18:43.480 --> 18:45.040
There must be a way!

18:45.070 --> 18:47.200
He earned merit on the battlefield.

18:48.000 --> 18:49.730
That should offset his faults,

18:49.750 --> 18:51.680
so he can at least save his life, right?

18:51.680 --> 18:52.480
General!

18:52.920 --> 18:54.830
General, please save him!

18:55.000 --> 18:56.830
Please save Qi Jiu!

18:56.830 --> 18:57.240
Zhen!

18:57.240 --> 18:59.030
Please save Qi Jiu!

18:59.070 --> 19:01.400
Please save Qi Jiu!

19:01.830 --> 19:02.920
If it were in the past,

19:02.920 --> 19:05.120
what you said might have been possible.

19:05.550 --> 19:06.640
But now,

19:06.880 --> 19:08.000
the one behind the Tian family

19:08.000 --> 19:09.930
is Wu Ru, the Commander of Nanjing.

19:10.310 --> 19:12.570
He and Marshal Qi are rivals in the court.

19:14.920 --> 19:16.590
Once something happens to Wenqian,

19:16.590 --> 19:18.440
he will definitely hold on to it,

19:18.680 --> 19:20.880
and Marshal Qi will also be implicated.

19:20.920 --> 19:22.120
The stakes involved—

19:22.790 --> 19:24.320
I think you can understand.

19:26.480 --> 19:27.350
Miss Li,

19:28.680 --> 19:32.680
Wenqian took the task of managing
military supplies and came to Huizhou

19:32.680 --> 19:34.640
just to seek revenge.

19:35.590 --> 19:37.550
As long as he doesn't
let go of this hatred,

19:37.550 --> 19:40.110
today's matter is inevitable.

19:40.640 --> 19:42.070
This is his fate.

19:42.830 --> 19:44.750
Neither of us can change it.

19:45.310 --> 19:46.790
What you should do right now

19:46.790 --> 19:48.200
is take these documents

19:48.240 --> 19:51.570
and go home early to settle things
in Li Ink and the Li family.

19:51.790 --> 19:53.190
As for Wenqian's matter,

19:54.160 --> 19:55.420
don't meddle anymore.

20:21.920 --> 20:23.270
Look, it's high up over there.

20:23.270 --> 20:24.160
Go over there later

20:24.160 --> 20:25.440
and keep watch for us.

20:26.400 --> 20:27.880
We're going to do
the Harvest Eve Foraging.

20:27.880 --> 20:29.680
You do the Harvest Eve Foraging,

20:30.000 --> 20:31.530
and I'll keep watch for you.

20:32.640 --> 20:33.400
Keep watch?

20:33.790 --> 20:35.440
You sound quite experienced.

20:35.440 --> 20:36.640
Someone taught me.

20:59.270 --> 21:00.160
Does it hurt?

21:01.880 --> 21:03.510
No, not at all.

21:09.840 --> 21:11.370
This rouge ink is yours now.

21:12.720 --> 21:14.110
Why do I smell...

21:14.350 --> 21:15.510
smell...

21:16.830 --> 21:18.400
the scent of rouge ink?

21:26.000 --> 21:28.440
Everyone has something they like to do.

21:28.790 --> 21:30.510
In the future,
I want to be an ink-making master

21:30.510 --> 21:33.510
much greater than my grandfather.

21:33.830 --> 21:36.000
I want everyone in Ming

21:36.240 --> 21:38.350
to know my name, Li Zhen.

21:38.550 --> 21:39.680
I believe you.

21:40.200 --> 21:42.200
Even without the tribute ink contract,

21:42.200 --> 21:43.110
you, Li Zhen,

21:43.960 --> 21:45.550
will definitely become

21:45.550 --> 21:47.640
the number one master ink maker in Ming.

21:47.640 --> 21:50.440
The number one master ink maker in Ming?

21:53.110 --> 21:54.400
Your words

21:55.070 --> 21:56.930
have reminded me of an old friend.

21:57.070 --> 21:58.680
If he were still alive,

21:59.110 --> 22:01.550
he would be around your age.

22:09.480 --> 22:11.080
This fish lantern is for you.

22:12.350 --> 22:13.160
Thank you.

22:17.310 --> 22:21.440
They all say the fireworks
and fish lanterns are a must-see

22:21.480 --> 22:23.640
on the Mid-Autumn Festival in Huizhou.

22:23.640 --> 22:26.960
Even though we only caught the tail end,

22:27.110 --> 22:28.510
we can't miss out on this.

22:30.960 --> 22:31.640
Thanks.

22:37.350 --> 22:38.270
Zhen,

22:40.720 --> 22:42.830
why are you so good?

22:45.590 --> 22:47.390
Why do you understand me so well?

22:49.640 --> 22:50.590
Our meeting...

22:54.440 --> 22:56.100
is a great blessing in my life.

23:23.970 --> 23:26.240
[Huizhou Prefecture Office]

23:26.440 --> 23:27.160
Mr. Zhang,

23:28.000 --> 23:28.920
a word, please.

23:29.750 --> 23:30.590
Manager Tian,

23:31.140 --> 23:32.740
it's done.

23:33.200 --> 23:33.920
Really?

23:34.400 --> 23:35.680
What did the Prefect say?

23:35.680 --> 23:37.720
The people from the Capital all

23:37.790 --> 23:39.650
identified Qi Jiu as Luo Wenqian.

23:39.750 --> 23:41.030
His Excellency has ordered

23:41.030 --> 23:42.200
him to be thrown in prison.

23:42.200 --> 23:43.680
Thank you for this.

23:43.830 --> 23:44.830
Tomorrow I will send someone

23:44.830 --> 23:46.000
to deliver the silver to your residence.

23:46.000 --> 23:47.000
You're welcome.

23:47.680 --> 23:48.310
Brother!

23:49.680 --> 23:50.480
Mr. Zhang.

23:50.830 --> 23:53.630
Li Zhen went to the military camp
to find Yu Dayong.

23:58.270 --> 23:59.110
Mr. Zhang,

24:00.400 --> 24:01.720
I have one more favor to ask.

24:01.720 --> 24:02.780
Feel free to speak.

24:07.590 --> 24:08.310
Granny.

24:08.830 --> 24:09.790
Wanyi?

24:10.830 --> 24:11.830
You are back.

24:12.210 --> 24:14.550
Is there any news
from the prefectural office?

24:14.550 --> 24:16.460
Master Qi has been imprisoned.

24:20.590 --> 24:22.880
It has come to this after all.

24:23.160 --> 24:25.640
Granny, someone wants to see you.

24:25.960 --> 24:26.830
Wait a moment.

24:35.560 --> 24:38.230
You really are Miss Luo?

24:39.130 --> 24:40.130
Eighth Master Li,

24:41.480 --> 24:43.030
I am Luo Mengzhen.

24:43.920 --> 24:45.440
My nephew Wenqian and I

24:45.920 --> 24:47.750
both owe the Li family.

24:48.510 --> 24:51.400
I kowtow to you, Eighth Master Li.

24:53.270 --> 24:54.530
Please get up quickly.

24:58.160 --> 24:59.750
What exactly happened?

25:00.550 --> 25:01.590
Back then,

25:03.480 --> 25:05.480
the Luo family suffered a disaster.

25:06.830 --> 25:08.350
I myself thought

25:09.160 --> 25:10.510
that fire

25:10.920 --> 25:13.310
would be the end of my life.

25:13.880 --> 25:15.480
But fate is tricky.

25:16.000 --> 25:19.350
Although I passed out from being burned,

25:19.830 --> 25:21.830
I still had a breath left.

25:22.640 --> 25:25.510
The government officials
thought I was dead

25:26.200 --> 25:28.400
and threw me into a mass grave.

25:29.540 --> 25:33.110
It was Rujun who pitied me
for not having a proper burial,

25:33.640 --> 25:35.110
so she came quietly

25:35.240 --> 25:37.410
to collect my body.

25:38.160 --> 25:39.560
That's when she realized

25:40.480 --> 25:42.160
I was not dead.

25:44.200 --> 25:45.550
Rujun and I

25:46.070 --> 25:48.200
had known each other since childhood.

25:48.830 --> 25:51.640
We were close friends.

25:52.350 --> 25:53.960
Seeing I was still alive,

25:54.350 --> 25:57.280
she brought me back to the Li family
to take care of me.

25:57.640 --> 25:59.070
She treated my wounds

25:59.680 --> 26:01.540
and looked after me day and night,

26:02.030 --> 26:05.030
pulling me back from the brink of death.

26:08.000 --> 26:09.000
I have never heard

26:09.880 --> 26:11.680
Rujun mention this.

26:12.920 --> 26:14.160
Mother told us

26:14.640 --> 26:16.160
not to tell anyone.

26:16.510 --> 26:18.170
It must have been hard for her.

26:21.830 --> 26:23.030
And hard for you too.

26:26.790 --> 26:27.790
Eighth Master Li.

26:28.550 --> 26:32.010
That day, when I came back
from offering paper money for Rujun,

26:32.350 --> 26:33.830
I ran into Wenqian.

26:35.550 --> 26:37.000
I recognized him,

26:37.790 --> 26:40.250
but I didn't dare
to acknowledge him rashly.

26:40.350 --> 26:42.210
It wasn't until he closed the shop

26:42.590 --> 26:44.720
that I finally confirmed

26:46.070 --> 26:48.510
Wenqian had come back for revenge.

26:50.640 --> 26:51.510
Too late.

26:52.750 --> 26:55.200
I said it too late after all.

26:57.750 --> 26:58.750
Eighth Master Li,

26:59.330 --> 27:02.090
if Wenqian
really dragged down the Li family

27:02.200 --> 27:03.550
and Miss Li Zhen,

27:04.200 --> 27:07.550
then I truly deserve to die!

27:11.830 --> 27:12.550
Mr. Zhou?

27:12.640 --> 27:14.510
Eighth Master Li, bad news!

27:14.680 --> 27:16.790
Some officers came to the house,

27:16.880 --> 27:18.950
saying they are going to
take the Li family members

27:18.950 --> 27:21.010
to the prefectural office for trial!

27:26.310 --> 27:27.480
What are you trying to do?

27:27.480 --> 27:27.750
Move!

27:27.750 --> 27:29.310
Which law did we break?

27:29.400 --> 27:31.680
Tell me, which law did we break?

27:31.960 --> 27:32.920
Cut the crap.

27:32.960 --> 27:33.510
Take them away!

27:33.510 --> 27:34.270
Go!

27:34.620 --> 27:35.210
You...

27:35.510 --> 27:36.350
Officers!

27:36.440 --> 27:37.270
Officers.

27:38.590 --> 27:39.440
Sir,

27:39.510 --> 27:40.480
what law did our Li family break?

27:40.480 --> 27:41.350
Why are you arresting us?

27:41.350 --> 27:43.000
Someone accused your Li family

27:43.000 --> 27:44.790
of colluding with the wanted criminal
Luo Wenqian.

27:44.790 --> 27:46.270
We are just doing our routine duties,

27:46.270 --> 27:48.830
taking all involved
to the prefectural office for questioning.

27:48.830 --> 27:49.550
Take them away!

27:49.550 --> 27:50.240
Go!

27:50.270 --> 27:51.160
My Lord!

27:52.510 --> 27:54.510
If you want to take the Li family to
the prefectural office for questioning,

27:54.510 --> 27:56.480
you must have the Prefect's warrant.

27:56.480 --> 27:57.790
Without that,

27:57.790 --> 27:58.830
no one can take

27:58.990 --> 28:01.390
any member of the Li family
out of this door!

28:03.030 --> 28:05.030
Don't bandy words with me.

28:05.750 --> 28:07.210
Everyone in Huizhou knows

28:07.350 --> 28:09.400
that Qi Jiu is Li Ink's shareholder.

28:09.830 --> 28:12.030
He is a wanted criminal
of the Imperial Court.

28:12.030 --> 28:13.750
Your Li family is deeply involved
with him.

28:13.750 --> 28:14.960
Based on this alone,

28:15.000 --> 28:16.550
I can arrest you all.

28:16.680 --> 28:18.070
You are wrong, My Lord.

28:18.680 --> 28:19.720
A month ago, Master Qi

28:19.720 --> 28:21.070
was no longer

28:21.160 --> 28:22.960
a shareholder of Li Ink.

28:23.310 --> 28:25.200
Yihousheng and Li Ink

28:25.200 --> 28:26.760
have had no business dealings
for a long time.

28:26.760 --> 28:28.890
I have the withdrawal letter as proof.

28:29.000 --> 28:30.640
It is written in black and white.

28:30.640 --> 28:32.500
You can check if you want, My Lord.

28:48.510 --> 28:50.440
Even if you have cut ties with them,

28:51.000 --> 28:53.260
your previous accounts may not be clean.

28:54.350 --> 28:55.160
My Lord,

28:55.350 --> 28:56.590
the accounts of Li Ink

28:56.590 --> 28:58.200
have always been clean.

28:58.270 --> 29:00.110
We are not afraid of your inspection.

29:00.110 --> 29:01.440
If you don't believe it,

29:01.460 --> 29:03.610
you can ask for the Prefect's warrant.

29:03.630 --> 29:04.790
Then our Li Ink

29:04.830 --> 29:06.730
will definitely open our accounting room

29:06.730 --> 29:09.060
and let you inspect the books thoroughly.

29:09.550 --> 29:10.590
However, today,

29:11.200 --> 29:13.060
you visited so suddenly, My Lord.

29:13.070 --> 29:14.750
I do have a question.

29:15.110 --> 29:16.720
Who is slandering

29:16.790 --> 29:18.400
our Li family behind this,

29:18.720 --> 29:20.880
making false accusations
without any evidence?

29:20.880 --> 29:22.640
They are simply shameless.

29:22.750 --> 29:24.000
I naturally believe

29:24.200 --> 29:26.160
the Prefect is clear-sighted

29:26.310 --> 29:27.970
and won't wrong our Li family.

29:28.640 --> 29:29.960
But if you, My Lord,

29:30.190 --> 29:32.110
insist on listening to others' words

29:32.110 --> 29:33.720
and forcibly take us away,

29:34.160 --> 29:36.820
then don't blame me
for reporting to the Prefect

29:36.880 --> 29:39.080
and accusing you of abusing your power!

29:48.720 --> 29:52.030
Tian Benchang, you bastard!

29:57.270 --> 29:58.070
Fine.

29:59.590 --> 30:00.240
Fine.

30:02.200 --> 30:04.330
I'll give you two more days of freedom.

30:05.550 --> 30:08.280
After I report today's situation
to the Prefect,

30:09.030 --> 30:11.200
I'll come back
and bring charges against you.

30:11.200 --> 30:12.440
Take care, My Lord.

30:14.200 --> 30:15.000
Let's go!

30:15.550 --> 30:17.210
We won't see you out, officer.

30:33.440 --> 30:34.240
Grandfather,

30:34.710 --> 30:36.310
tell everyone to wait for me.

30:45.070 --> 30:46.070
Tian Benchang,

30:47.110 --> 30:49.350
you went to the prefectural office
to report the Li family, didn't you?

30:49.350 --> 30:50.240
So what if I did?

30:51.810 --> 30:54.030
I know you went to the military camp
to find Yu Dayong.

30:54.030 --> 30:55.310
This time

30:56.030 --> 30:57.160
is to warn you.

30:57.920 --> 31:00.680
I advise you not to interfere
in Luo Wenqian's affairs anymore.

31:00.680 --> 31:02.590
You may have gotten away with it today
by mentioning the warrant,

31:02.590 --> 31:03.480
but next time,

31:04.270 --> 31:05.670
you might not be so lucky.

31:06.550 --> 31:07.350
Alright.

31:08.480 --> 31:09.830
Let's wait and see.

31:22.310 --> 31:23.110
Grandfather.

31:23.790 --> 31:25.990
Regarding Master Qi and Ugly Granny Li,

31:26.070 --> 31:28.070
I only found out about it yesterday.

31:28.920 --> 31:30.310
The top priority now

31:30.830 --> 31:33.070
is to not let this
implicate the Li family.

31:33.070 --> 31:35.470
So we need to come up
with a countermeasure.

31:36.070 --> 31:36.920
Zhen,

31:37.480 --> 31:38.680
you must already

31:38.880 --> 31:40.270
have a plan.

31:40.680 --> 31:41.920
Tell us.

31:47.160 --> 31:48.000
First,

31:48.790 --> 31:50.070
although Master Qi

31:50.350 --> 31:52.000
has signed the share withdrawal document

31:52.000 --> 31:53.400
and severed ties

31:53.510 --> 31:54.680
with Li Ink,

31:55.480 --> 31:56.480
the Tian family will inevitably dwell

31:56.480 --> 31:58.200
on our past dealings.

31:59.000 --> 32:00.060
So Uncle Jingdong,

32:00.070 --> 32:02.310
I need you to work with Steward Shao
these days

32:02.310 --> 32:04.310
to sort out our past accounts

32:04.310 --> 32:05.350
with Yihousheng.

32:05.590 --> 32:08.030
We must not let the Tian family
find any flaws.

32:08.030 --> 32:08.720
Okay.

32:09.000 --> 32:09.750
Second,

32:10.750 --> 32:14.150
Ugly Granny Li was personally saved
by Seventh Grandmother.

32:14.200 --> 32:15.720
Seventh Grandmother's decision

32:15.720 --> 32:17.920
is the decision of the entire Li family.

32:19.750 --> 32:20.790
So Eldest Aunt,

32:21.400 --> 32:24.200
our Li family
must continue to keep her safe.

32:24.440 --> 32:25.270
We must continue

32:25.270 --> 32:26.720
to conceal her identity

32:26.880 --> 32:29.350
and avoid causing any further trouble.

32:31.540 --> 32:32.880
Mother and I already handled

32:32.880 --> 32:33.960
her registration documents

32:33.960 --> 32:35.920
a few years ago,

32:36.350 --> 32:38.880
including her relationship with Doggie.

32:39.030 --> 32:40.270
Even if they investigate,

32:40.270 --> 32:41.310
they won't find anything.

32:41.310 --> 32:42.440
Don't worry about this.

32:42.440 --> 32:43.200
Good.

32:43.270 --> 32:44.110
That's good.

32:44.750 --> 32:45.640
Third,

32:46.350 --> 32:47.590
as everyone has seen,

32:48.110 --> 32:49.440
Master Qi was just imprisoned,

32:49.440 --> 32:50.880
and the Tian family couldn't sit still.

32:50.880 --> 32:52.480
Besides deliberately trying to suppress

32:52.480 --> 32:53.940
and slander our Li family,

32:54.160 --> 32:55.220
more importantly,

32:55.680 --> 32:58.480
they are afraid of their crime
of illicit foreign trade being exposed.

32:58.480 --> 32:59.810
Illicit foreign trade?

33:00.030 --> 33:01.360
That's a serious crime.

33:03.680 --> 33:04.480
Grandfather.

33:04.720 --> 33:06.180
Previously, Master Qi...

33:08.960 --> 33:10.360
Previously, Luo Wenqian

33:11.150 --> 33:13.110
had been investigating this matter.

33:13.110 --> 33:14.240
But in the end,

33:14.440 --> 33:15.570
he was one step short

33:16.230 --> 33:18.510
and couldn't catch the Tian family
red-handed.

33:18.510 --> 33:19.720
The Tian family

33:20.030 --> 33:21.880
is a disgrace to Hui Ink!

33:22.540 --> 33:25.680
First, they bullied Third Master Chen
over the Tribute Ink matter,

33:25.680 --> 33:27.720
then they forced Manager Pan to his death,

33:27.720 --> 33:30.000
and now they dare
to engage in illicit foreign trade?

33:30.000 --> 33:31.830
We can no longer let this Tian family

33:31.830 --> 33:34.590
continue to harm our Huizhou ink industry.

33:35.610 --> 33:37.010
Uncle Jingdong is right.

33:37.880 --> 33:41.010
The key to all these disasters
lies with the Tian family.

33:41.960 --> 33:43.640
So I have made a decision.

33:45.590 --> 33:46.510
I want to

33:47.680 --> 33:51.240
continue investigating their
illicit foreign trade for Luo Wenqian.

33:51.240 --> 33:52.350
I know

33:52.550 --> 33:53.880
it's extremely risky.

33:54.670 --> 33:55.760
So today,

33:56.030 --> 33:57.680
I want to ask for everyone's opinion.

33:57.680 --> 33:59.270
Instead of waiting to die,

33:59.310 --> 34:00.910
it's better to strike first!

34:01.000 --> 34:02.070
I support you.

34:04.400 --> 34:05.200
Zhen.

34:05.790 --> 34:06.920
If the sky falls,

34:07.440 --> 34:08.760
I will hold it up for you.

34:08.760 --> 34:10.000
Go ahead and do it.

34:10.230 --> 34:11.670
God has eyes!

34:15.000 --> 34:15.800
That's right.

34:16.400 --> 34:17.150
Zhen.

34:17.760 --> 34:19.630
We can't lose our pride.

34:20.630 --> 34:21.800
I support you too.

34:23.840 --> 34:24.590
Zhen.

34:27.070 --> 34:28.800
Our whole family supports you.

34:33.670 --> 34:34.590
Okay.

34:36.840 --> 34:37.670
Okay.

36:10.510 --> 36:11.590
This is what

36:13.760 --> 36:15.670
you've been hiding from me.

36:22.760 --> 36:23.800
Luo Wenqian.

36:35.230 --> 36:36.070
I'm sorry.

36:41.150 --> 36:43.010
You don't need to apologize to me.

36:43.960 --> 36:44.960
I don't blame you.

36:46.630 --> 36:47.480
I know

36:48.000 --> 36:49.440
you kept it from me

36:50.400 --> 36:51.510
because

36:52.030 --> 36:53.800
you're a fugitive

36:54.230 --> 36:56.160
who wants revenge for a blood feud.

36:56.760 --> 36:58.510
You were afraid of implicating me

36:58.510 --> 36:59.960
and the Li family, right?

37:01.960 --> 37:03.230
But Wenqian,

37:04.190 --> 37:05.880
we are already together.

37:06.920 --> 37:08.450
When two people are in love,

37:08.960 --> 37:11.760
they should embrace everything
about each other.

37:12.400 --> 37:13.920
Whether it's joy

37:14.510 --> 37:15.920
or sorrow.

37:16.800 --> 37:18.630
No matter what happens,

37:18.840 --> 37:20.760
we should face it together.

37:21.630 --> 37:23.550
Now, to keep me safe,

37:24.230 --> 37:25.550
you pushed me away.

37:26.400 --> 37:27.840
In your heart,

37:29.320 --> 37:31.650
am I not someone
who can stand by your side?

37:35.920 --> 37:36.760
Zhen,

37:39.280 --> 37:41.210
how could I not know your feelings?

37:42.880 --> 37:44.280
But this matter

37:45.070 --> 37:46.440
is no small thing.

37:48.510 --> 37:49.480
I don't want to

37:51.550 --> 37:53.360
drag you into the fire.

38:04.320 --> 38:05.630
A loss is a loss.

38:20.890 --> 38:22.250
Right now, outside,

38:27.760 --> 38:29.890
there is someone else waiting for you.

39:04.150 --> 39:05.150
Who made this?

39:06.960 --> 39:07.920
Your aunt.

39:09.480 --> 39:10.740
Ugly Granny Li made it.

39:16.280 --> 39:18.230
Ugly Granny Li is Luo Mengzhen.

39:20.030 --> 39:22.560
Regarding the fire
at Jingxin Hall back then,

39:23.280 --> 39:25.610
it was Seventh Grandmother who saved her.

39:27.440 --> 39:29.500
She kept her by her side to protect her

39:29.510 --> 39:30.590
until today.

39:31.760 --> 39:32.840
Over the years,

39:33.920 --> 39:36.180
she has been keeping her identity hidden

39:36.320 --> 39:38.550
for fear that someone would mention it.

39:42.440 --> 39:44.510
She knew that I came to see you today,

39:44.760 --> 39:46.960
but it was inconvenient for her to come.

39:47.360 --> 39:50.840
So she made you
this Weighing Rod-Shaped Candy.

39:53.320 --> 39:54.440
She said when you were little,

39:54.440 --> 39:56.100
this was your favorite candy.

39:56.670 --> 39:57.880
Prison is hard.

39:59.030 --> 40:00.360
After eating the candy,

40:01.280 --> 40:02.710
you won't feel so sad.

40:02.880 --> 40:03.760
Is...

40:04.230 --> 40:05.440
Is she alright?

40:19.440 --> 40:20.360
Wenqian.

40:22.000 --> 40:23.510
There are still many people out there

40:23.510 --> 40:24.920
who are helping you.

40:26.190 --> 40:27.760
Even if it's for everyone,

40:28.670 --> 40:29.590
and me,

40:30.920 --> 40:32.400
you can't give up.

40:33.360 --> 40:34.400
Understand?

40:35.590 --> 40:36.760
Promise me,

40:37.150 --> 40:38.030
okay?

40:39.760 --> 40:40.670
I promise you.

40:41.880 --> 40:42.670
I promise.

40:51.360 --> 40:52.030
Zhen.

40:52.590 --> 40:55.360
The Tian family
set up another secret ink workshop,

40:55.360 --> 40:57.550
most likely because the contraband ink

40:57.550 --> 40:59.550
has a special style
or distinctive markings.

40:59.550 --> 41:01.280
You and Xiao Qi can start
by checking the ink

41:01.280 --> 41:02.510
or tools.

41:03.110 --> 41:03.640
Let's go.

41:03.920 --> 41:04.590
Wenqian,

41:05.020 --> 41:06.840
the ink workshop
used to make contraband ink

41:06.840 --> 41:07.970
has been cleaned up.

41:08.030 --> 41:09.030
The ink

41:09.230 --> 41:11.400
and tools have been transferred.

41:11.630 --> 41:15.230
Tian Benchang will definitely find
another place to store them.

41:15.840 --> 41:17.550
We have already checked

41:18.030 --> 41:20.920
all suspicious ink workshops
held by the Tian family.

41:20.920 --> 41:23.400
Xiao Qi has well-organized information.

41:23.840 --> 41:24.770
Let him help you.

41:27.520 --> 41:29.480
Although there's nothing to investigate
at the ink workshop,

41:29.480 --> 41:31.080
there are still ink-makers.

41:31.510 --> 41:33.030
As long as the Tian family did this,

41:33.030 --> 41:34.430
there must be witnesses.

41:34.510 --> 41:35.630
Generally speaking,

41:35.630 --> 41:37.550
ink-makers legally employed
by ink workshops

41:37.550 --> 41:39.630
are all registered
with the Literary Association.

41:39.630 --> 41:40.510
I guess

41:40.710 --> 41:42.280
the ink-makers the Tian family hired

41:42.280 --> 41:44.440
must be unrecorded

41:44.550 --> 41:45.880
freelance ink-makers.

41:46.070 --> 41:48.730
But there are countless ink-makers
in Huizhou.

41:49.400 --> 41:51.570
If you want to investigate thoroughly,

41:51.570 --> 41:53.570
I'm afraid you'll be short of hands.

41:55.400 --> 41:56.550
You can ask

41:57.150 --> 41:58.190
Cuiqiao for help.

42:01.110 --> 42:02.030
Understand?

42:02.230 --> 42:03.150
Yes!

42:13.960 --> 42:14.760
Wenqian.

42:15.150 --> 42:17.150
Recently, Commander Wu used your matter

